{"780270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brimstone Brawlers - Early Access", "steam_appid": 780270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1338700], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brimstone Brawlers</strong> is a chaotic brawler set in a city on the brink of collapse, where toxic industry, black magic, and unchecked violence have turned the streets into a battleground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Brawlers</strong> –  A line-up of cursed townsfolk, rogue inventors, and unlicensed exorcists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hazardous Arenas</strong> – Exploding barrels, collapsing catwalks and toxic sludge. The environment fights back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local &amp; Online Multiplayer</strong> – Brawl solo, with bots, with friends, or randoms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Campaign</strong> – Battle through a series of handcrafted fights with unique modifiers, challenges, and boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Gothic Setting</strong> – A city that looks like it’s held together by rust, grime, and dark magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brawlers - Unlock more by playing the game!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780270/extras/63554fa926e5d93272714aa83f84fcda.avif?t=1745664247\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><strong>Dynamic 3D Arenas - Trick your friends with explosive map mechanics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780270/extras/8c73b2f6504c557513c32a27aae1b330.poster.avif?t=1745664247\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea