p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local &amp; Online Multiplayer</strong> – Brawl solo, with bots, with friends, or randoms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Campaign</strong> – Battle through a series of handcrafted fights with unique modifiers, challenges, and boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Gothic Setting</strong> – A city that looks like it’s held together by rust, grime, and dark magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brawlers - Unlock more by playing the game!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780270/extras/63554fa926e5d93272714aa83f84fcda.avif?t=1745664247\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><strong>Dynamic 3D Arenas - Trick your friends with explosive map mechanics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780270/extras/8c73b2f6504c557513c32a27aae1b330.poster.avif?t=1745664247\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780270/extras/8c73b2f6504c557513c32a27aae1b330.webm?t=1745664247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780270/extras/8c73b2f6504c557513c32a27aae1b330.mp4?t=1745664247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brawl, Bash, or Ball – Multiple game modes to test your skill and crush your rivals.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/780270/extras/fe3950e587b5184cc9255bec913b95e3.poster.avif?t=1745664247\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta